  "body": "Hi I'm working at the University of Szeged in the team working on Web Bluetooth in servo. I found a typo in function https://webbluetoothcg.github.io/web-bluetooth/#dom-bluetoothremotegattcharacteristic-readvalue (Step 2). In `this.characteristic.service.device.gatt` the characteristic does not have a `characteristic` field just a `service`. So in this case `this.service.device.gatt` should be the correct phrasing.\n",
